  "goodToKnow": "Rotieren means to rotate: Die Erde rotiert, ein rotierender Ventilator. Colloquially, it means to be frantically busy or in a flap: Ich rotiere gerade (I'm swamped). In sport and work, it means to take turns: Die Spieler rotieren. Die Rotation is rotation, and das Rotationsprinzip is rotation of positions. From Latin rota (wheel). Participle: rotiert."
